							Beckhoff Automation Poland
									07.06.2018
	Blok do uzupełniania offsetu w enkoderze/AX5000
	Obsluguje bledy zwiazane z wymiana silnika na nowy - bez wpisanego offsetu.
	Naprawia błąd: 	0x0000F340- Position offset invalid.
					0x0000F341- Position offset: No position offset excisting.
	Aby wpisać wartość, silnik musi być wyłączony.
	Niezbędne biblioteki:
	Tc2_MC2;	Tc2_Utilities;	Tc2_MC2_Drive;	Tc2_EtherCAT, Tc2_Drive;

	v2.4 || TC v 3.1.4022.20 || - Usuniecie nieużywanych zmiennych, zabezpieczenie przed zerowa pozycja, optymalizacje
	v2.2 || TC v 3.1.4022.2	 || - Poprawka w komentarzu, uiSoEErrorID zamiast udiSoEErrorID
	v2.1 || TC v 3.1.4022.0	 || - Uproszczono kod
	v2.0 || TC v 3.1.4022.0	 || - Dodano obsługę AX52xx, przebudowano bloczek z wykorzystaniem FB_ChangeSlaveState
	v1.0 || TC v 3.1.4020.32 || - Pierwsza wersja
==================================================================================================]]></Comment><BitSize>92416</BitSize><SubItem><Name>bExecute</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ rising edge starts sequence]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>64</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>lrPosition</Name><Type>LREAL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Write new encoder position]]></Comment><BitSize>64</BitSize><BitOffs>128</BitOffs><Default><Value>0.001</Value></Default><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>bRelative</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ When this flag is set, the position is relatively interpreted]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>192</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>eFeedback</Name><Type Namespace="Tc2_MC2_Drive">E_PositionOffsetFeedback</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ ePositionOffsetFeedback1:= 0			ePositionOffsetFeedback2 := 1]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>200</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>eMemory</Name><Type Namespace="Tc2_MC2_Drive">E_PositionOffsetMemory</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ ePositionOffsetMemory_Encoder:= 0	ePositionOffsetMemory_Drive := 1]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>208</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>bBusy</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>216</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>bError</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>224</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>udiErrorID</Name><