==================================================================================================]]></Comment><BitSize>325824</BitSize><ExtendsType>FB_McAxisOnline_NC</ExtendsType><SubItem><Name>fbMotorMonitoring</Name><Type>FB_MotorMonitoringEL72xx</Type><BitSize>6016</BitSize><BitOffs>194112</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>fbHoldingBrakeCtrl</Name><Type>FB_HoldingBrakeCtrlEL72xx</Type><BitSize>7296</BitSize><BitOffs>200128</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>tonGetDriveDiag</Name><Type Namespace="Tc2_Standard">TON</Type><BitSize>256</BitSize><BitOffs>207424</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>fbReadChannelErrorCode</Name><Type>FB_ReadChannelErrorCodeEL72xx</Type><BitSize>3712</BitSize><BitOffs>207680</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>fbSetPositionOffset</Name><Type Namespace="Tc2_MC2_Drive">FB_CoEEL72xxSetPositionOffset</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Requires FW >= 19 Rev >= 30!		(check motor type if have multiturn enc to save in enc)		https://infosys.beckhoff.com/content/1033/tcplclib_tc2_mc2_drive/7604235915.html?id=9112637119101863462]]></Comment><BitSize>60288</BitSize><BitOffs>211392</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>fbDeletePositionOffset</Name><Type Namespace="Tc2_MC2_Drive">FB_CoEEL72xxDeletePositionOffset</Type><BitSize>48768</BitSize><BitOffs>271680</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>mcReadDriveAddress</Name><Type Namespace="Tc2_MC2">MC_ReadDriveAddress</Type><BitSize>3136</BitSize><BitOffs>320448</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>fbGetDriveRef</Name><Type>FB_GetDriveRef</Type><BitSize>2176</BitSize><BitOffs>323584</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>bDriveAddressReady</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Initialization]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>325760</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>bDriveRefReady</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>325768</BitOffs></SubItem><Method><Name>M_MotorMonitoring</Name><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize></Method><Method><Name>M_ErrorCollection</Name><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize></Method><Method><Name>M_DeletePositionIO</Name><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize></Method><Method><Name>M_SetPositionIO</Name><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize></Method><Method><Name>M_DriveDiag</Name><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize></Method><Method><Name>M_Init_EL72xx</Name><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize></Method><Method><Name>M_HoldingBrakeCtrl</Name><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize></Method><Properties><Property><Name>PouType</Name><Value>FunctionBlock</Value></Property><Property><Name>reflection</Name></Property></Properties></DataType><DataType><Name>FB_MotorMonitoringELM72xx</Name><Comment><![CDATA[==================================================================================================
							Beckhoff Automation Poland
									06.02.2024
	Blok funkcyjny pozwala na monitorowanie i ograniczanie momentu oraz monitoring parametru I2T dla EL72xx.
	Zmienne do zlinkowania zadeklarowane są wewnątrz bloku.
	Ograniczenie i monitorowanie momentu
	Ograniczenie momentu podawane jest przez wejście rTorqueLimit.
	Na wyjściu podana jest wartość surowa w %, jak i przeskalowana na A (prąd) i Nm (moment).
	Blok zwraca wartości bieżące, przefiltrowane i maksymalne.
	Wartości maksymalne mogą być wyzerowane za pomocą zmiennej bReset.
	Wewnętrznie wykorzystany jest blok FB_FilterEx.

  v1.0	|| TC v 3.1.4024.53		|| - pierwsza wersja
==================================================================================================]]></Comment><BitSize>5312</BitSize><SubItem><Name>rTorqueLimitLow</Name><Type>REAL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Low limit used for bipolar torque limit value]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>64</BitOffs><Default><Value>0.01</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name>rTorqueLimitHigh</Name><Type>REAL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ High limit used for bipolar torque limit value]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>96</BitOffs><Default><Value>500</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name>bReset</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Reset FB]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>128</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>rTorqueLimit</Name><Type>REAL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Bipolar torque limit: 0-500%, resolution 0.1%, value goes to: 16#6072 (Ch A)/ 16#6872 (Ch B)	]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>160</BitOffs><Default><Value>500</Value></Default><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>stDriveRef</Name><Type Namespace="Tc2_EtherCAT">ST_DriveRef</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Necessary for FB_CoERead_ByDriveRef]]></Comment><BitSize>224</BitSize><BitOffs>192</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>bError</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ General error: parameter or CoE read.]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>416</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>uiAdsErrId</Name><Type>UINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Forwarded output FB_CoERead_ByDriveRef]]></Comment><BitSize>16</BitSize><BitOffs>432</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>uiCANopenErrId</Name><Type>U